# 2. Copy the "Project URL" into SUPABASE_URL
# 3. Copy the "anon public" key into SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# 4. (Optional) Copy the "service_role" secret key into SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY for server operations

